SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 GMT: Studio Voltaire: Tender Living Residency 2027 (
 trans and non-binary artists\; GBP 300/week for 10 weeks)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 22 Nov 2026 at 23:59 GMT.\n\nA ten-week live/work reside
 ncy at Studio Voltaire in London for emerging trans\, non-binary or gender
 -questioning visual artists. ELIGIBILITY: emerging artists based in the UK
  outside London. OFFER: GBP 300 per week for 10 weeks\, a live/work studio
 \, mentoring and access funds. APPLY by email in written\, video or audio 
 form\; interviews in the week of 7 December 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Studio 
 Voltaire\nLocation: London\, UK (live/work studio). For artists based in t
 he UK outside London.\nAward: GBP 300 per week for 10 weeks (GBP 3\,000)\,
  plus mentoring and access funds.\nDuration: 3 February to 14 April 2027\n
 \nMore: https://studiovoltaire.org/residencies/open-call-tender-living-res
 idency/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://studiovoltaire.org/residencies/open-call-tender-living-residenc
 y/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:London\, UK (live/work studio). For artists based in the UK outsid
 e London.
END:VEVENT
