SUMMARY:Deadline 12:00 GMT: National Festival of Making: Art in Manufacturi
 ng Open Call 2027 (GBP 8\,000 factory residencies)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 23 Nov 2026 at 12:00 GMT.\n\nTwo paid residencies inside
  working factories (Crown Paints and Fox's Burton's Companies)\, with the 
 resulting work shown at the National Festival of Making in Blackburn in la
 te June 2027. ELIGIBILITY: artists and makers\, individuals or collectives
 \, based in the UK or Ireland. OFFER: GBP 8\,000 commission per residency 
 plus up to GBP 600 travel and accommodation.\n\nOrganisation: National Fes
 tival of Making\nLocation: Darwen and Blackpool\, UK\, with the festival i
 n Blackburn in late June 2027. Artists based in the UK or Ireland.\nAward:
  GBP 8\,000 commission per residency plus up to GBP 600 travel and accommo
 dation.\nDuration: January to June 2027\n\nMore: https://festivalofmaking.
 co.uk/news/art-in-manufacturing-open-call-crown-paints-foxs-burtons-compan
 ies-uk/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
