SUMMARY:Deadline 12:00 GMT: Cryptic Nights 2027/28 Open Call (sound\, perfo
 rmance and technology\, Scotland)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 19 Nov 2026 at 12:00 GMT.\n\nCryptic Nights supports eme
 rging Scotland-based artists making work that combines original sound or m
 usic with performance\, screen or technology\, to develop an existing piec
 e and present it in Cryptic's programme. Selected artists receive a fee\, 
 residency time\, mentoring and travel and access support. No application f
 ee.\n\nOrganisation: Cryptic\, Glasgow\nLocation: Glasgow\, Scotland. Open
  to emerging artists based in Scotland.\nAward: GBP 800 fee for solo artis
 ts\, up to GBP 2\,000 for groups\, plus residency days\, mentoring\, trave
 l and access budgets.\nDuration: Development and presentation through the 
 2027/28 Cryptic Nights programme.\n\nMore: https://www.cryptic.org.uk/cryp
 tic-nights-2027-28-open-call/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_me
 dium=referral
URL:https://www.cryptic.org.uk/cryptic-nights-2027-28-open-call/?utm_source
 =artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Glasgow\, Scotland. Open to emerging artists based in Scotland.
END:VEVENT
